1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,470
Bonjour. We begin by merging two clusters.

2
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:13,330
Next, merge that result with a third cluster.

3
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:22,790
Then make an unrelated merge, and mark it as multi-unit
activity.

4
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,790
Return to the older, nested merge.

5
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:33,030
One restore brings back all three original clusters.

6
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:36,210
Undo and redo affect the whole restoration.

7
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,610
Leaving Merge Mode keeps them separate.

8
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,010
Exclude the third cluster.

9
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:46,290
Remerge the pair: SLAY turns green again.

10
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,790
Undo and redo update the status.

11
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:57,110
Save and reopen: the result and later edits are preserved.
